{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11104100","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11104100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110410001:1":{"text":"聞いたぞ、初参戦で<style=\"highlight\">血の試練</style>と<style=\"highlight\">魂の試練</style>を突破したらしいな。","source_cn":"有人告诉我，你初次参赛，就通过了<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FACDC562E71393C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110410002:1":{"text":"それにブルータスにも認められたそうじゃないか。俺たちブラックロアーは弱者を忌み嫌うが、お前は十分自分の強さを示した。","source_cn":"连布鲁特斯都称赞了你，黑嚎氏族厌弃的只是弱者。而你，已...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA95D28B72BE44E65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110410003:1":{"text":"だからブラックロアーの族長であるこのオルグが、お前を――","source_cn":"现在，我奥格作为黑嚎氏族的首领，向你发出邀请——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE10787B417C2CC33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110410004:1":{"text":"オレを？ブラックロアーに迎え入れる？","source_cn":"邀请我……回到黑嚎？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x536FEEC6BDEAE977","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110410005:1":{"text":"強き者は同じく強き者と共にいるべきだ。それは俺が誰よりも分かっている。","source_cn":"强者，该与强者为伍。我比任何人都理解这一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB74491DFD7229AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110410006:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">ブラックロアーがなぜ強いか分かるか</style>？俺たちにひれ伏した敵は皆こう言うのだ……","source_cn":"<style=highlight>黑嚎氏族为何如此强大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74308B3C5ECF5710","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110410007:1":{"text":"……なんておぞましい強さだ、とな。","source_cn":"……真是令人厌恶的强大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE77BB24322F2FA71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110410008:1":{"text":"ソーン、お前はまだ若いから理解できないだろうが……なぜ同じババリアにも、弱者と強者がいると思う？","source_cn":"索恩，你还年轻，不懂得……蛮血都是血肉之躯，为何有人弱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E4C5167C2C258EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110410009:1":{"text":"答えは簡単だ。強き者は力を得るためなら、すべてを犠牲にできる。","source_cn":"答案很简单。强者为了追逐力量，可以抛弃一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF01C61BFCDC699B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110410010:1":{"text":"だが弱者は愚かで欲張りだ。奴らは何でもかんでも「守り」たがり、その手を放そうとしない。","source_cn":"弱者则愚蠢又贪婪，他们什么都想……“保护”，想要抓在手心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78B315F36B759E78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110410011:1":{"text":"それの何が間違ってるの？","source_cn":"这又有什么错？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE25ED5B6CBF9FCDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110410012:1":{"text":"アルサだったな？大間違いだとも。弱者の空虚な誓いに意味などないのだよ。","source_cn":"阿尔萨，是吗？大错特错，弱者虚伪的诺言没有意义。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CB892A7FDE3C447","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110410013:1":{"text":"この残酷で貧相な大地では、脆弱な体と脆い意志は他者に虐げられる定めなのだ。","source_cn":"在这片残酷的贫瘠之地，脆弱的身体和虚弱的意志注定处于劣势。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72700C97F78CC713","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110410014:1":{"text":"帰ってこい、ソーン。安心しろ、俺たちブラックロアーに軟弱者はいない。","source_cn":"回归氏族吧，索恩。我向你保证，黑嚎氏族不是那种软弱的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AFB84BD9383F556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110410015:1":{"text":"強者が集うこの場所では、力だけがものを言う。十分な力さえあれば、誰もお前には逆らわない。","source_cn":"这里强者林立，只靠力量说话。只要你足够强，便能无所顾忌。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8F34192BC198D77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110410016:1":{"text":"帰らない。","source_cn":"不要。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA7C6B34B88BA56D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110410017:1":{"text":"……ふっ、強者の矜持か？広い心を持て、ソーン。過去をいつまでも引きずるのは弱者のすることだ。","source_cn":"……哼，强者的矜持，是吗？但你如此记恨当年的事，这就不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA9304E2BCBBC9DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110410018:1":{"text":"ブラックロアーの今があるのは、弱さを徹底的に排除してきたからだ。いつかお前が俺と同じ立場になれば、きっとさらに――","source_cn":"如果容忍软弱，黑嚎氏族不会走到今天。如果有一天，你处在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2866508295C6AB30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110410019:1":{"text":"ばかばかしい。そんな日は絶対に来ない。","source_cn":"别妄想了，奥格。不会有那一天的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCD864FEC26E1622","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110410020:1":{"text":"オレには自分の氏族がある。ブラックロアーに帰属するなど、想像しただけで反吐が出るね……","source_cn":"我有我自己的氏族。要做黑嚎的族人？这件事只是想想，就让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0710B809C2CA8A16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1110410021:1":{"text":"自分の氏族だ